---
/*
 * Override of Starlight's `ThemeProvider`.
 *
 * The Aconite manual is dark-mode only. Unlike the stock provider, this one
 * does NOT read `localStorage` or the OS `prefers-color-scheme`: it forces
 * `data-theme="dark"` unconditionally, so the site always renders dark
 * regardless of any prior stored preference or system setting.
 *
 * `window.StarlightThemeProvider.updatePickers` is still defined as a no-op so
 * that any code expecting the global (e.g. an inlined picker script) does not
 * throw. The theme-select control itself is overridden away separately.
 */
---

{/* Intentionally inlined to avoid FOUC. */}
<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark';
	window.StarlightThemeProvider = {
		updatePickers() {},
	};
</script>
